mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"1o0uu-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"1o0uu-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">책상배치를 본인반에 맞게 배치하는 기능</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"scbc-0-0\" data-editor=\"2af3e\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"scbc-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"scbc-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">남녀 자동으로 자리 바꾸는 기능</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"90in9-0-0\" data-editor=\"2af3e\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"90in9-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"90in9-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">저장을 5개가 아니라 무한대로 할 수 있는 기능</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"dmsdk-0-0\" data-editor=\"2af3e\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"dmsdk-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"dmsdk-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-text=\"true\">출력할때 번호도 함께 출력되는 기능등</span></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-offset-key=\"981vb-0-0\" data-editor=\"2af3e\" data-block=\"true\"><div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; position: relative; direction: ltr;\" data-offset-key=\"981vb-0-0\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\" data-offset-key=\"981vb-0-0\"><br data-text=\"true\"></span></div></div><div style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-c